OL,3,GNEWSAWest Indian carnival still thrills
OL,4,Aafter 59 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fgathered for the 59th Leeds West Indian
OL,8,FCarnival.
OL,10,FThe event is the country's largest such
OL,11,Fevent outside London.
OL,13,FAbout 100,000 visitors arrive from
OL,14,Foutside the city for the event each
OL,15,Fyear, including from Manchester,
OL,16,FLeicester, Bradford and Wolverhampton.
OL,18,FThe carnival, which began in 1967 and
OL,19,Fis held on the last weekend in August,
OL,20,Fcelebrates Caribbean music, dance, food
OL,21,Fand culture.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
